<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive"><title>My Hospital Review · I Love My Body</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/ilmb-brand.css?v=5"><style>
:root{--pink:#FF008C;--line:rgba(0,0,0,.16);--muted:rgba(0,0,0,.62)}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:#000;font:14px/1.48 Arial,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1600px;margin:auto;padding:16px 16px 60px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center}.brand b{display:block;font-size:20px}.brand small{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em}.back{color:var(--pink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}.hero{margin:18px 0 12px;padding:20px;border:1px solid #000;border-radius:16px}.hero h1{margin:4px 0 7px;font-size:36px;line-height:1}.hero p{max-width:1050px;color:var(--muted)}.ey{color:var(--pink);font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}.sum,.section,.result,.doc,.path,.deep-card{padding:13px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #000;background:#fff}.sum b{font-size:24px}.sum span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.section{margin-top:10px;padding:15px}h2{margin:3px 0 5px;font-size:24px}.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:1100px;margin:4px 0 9px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}.pill{display:inline-block;padding:3px 6px;border:1px solid #000;border-radius:999px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}.medicine-table{overflow:auto;border:1px solid #000;border-radius:10px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:1550px}th,td{padding:9px;border-right:1px solid #000;border-bottom:1px solid #000;vertical-align:top;text-align:left}th{background:#000;color:#fff;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;position:sticky;top:0}td:first-child{font-weight:900}.path-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}.path{border-top:4px solid var(--pink)}.path h3{margin:4px 0 7px}.path dl{margin:0}.path dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:9px;padding:6px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.path dt{font-weight:900;color:var(--pink)}.path dd{margin:0}.deep-grid{display:grid;gap:8px}.deep-card{border-left:5px solid var(--pink)}.deep-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:180px 1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.deep-head b{font-size:15px}.deep-head span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.causal{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:stretch;overflow-x:auto;margin-top:8px}.node{min-width:150px;padding:7px;border:1px solid #000;border-radius:8px}.node b{display:block;font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em}.node p{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:10px}.arrow{display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--pink);font-weight:900}.matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px;margin-top:8px}.cell{border-left:3px solid var(--pink);padding-left:7px}.cell b{display:block;font-size:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}.cell p{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:10px}.loop,.boundary{margin-top:10px;padding:10px;border:2px solid var(--pink);border-radius:9px}.loop{font-weight:900;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace}.docs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px}.doc small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.identity{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.identity span{padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #000;font-size:10px}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.actions a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #000;color:#000;background:#fff}.actions a.primary{background:var(--pink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--pink)}@media(max-width:900px){.summary,.cards,.docs,.path-grid,.matrix{grid-template-columns:1fr}.deep-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column-reverse}.path dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:30px}}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><div class="top"><a class="back" href="/app/">← My Happy Space</a><div class="brand"><b>I Love My Body</b><small>MY HOSPITAL REVIEW</small></div></div><section class="hero"><div class="ey">PHARMACY = ILMB · FULL CAUSAL FLOW</div><h1>Understand exactly what each treatment changes.</h1><p>Medicine + dose → target → target's normal job → body part → desired output → why it helps → collateral branch → ILMB route to the same output → ChEBI/LOINC/pathway/therapy convergence → pH gate → measurement → decision.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/app/test-results.php">Add exact test values</a><a href="/app/#records">Upload reports / prescriptions</a></div></section><div id="loading">Building your review…</div><div id="content" hidden><div class="summary"><div class="sum"><div class="ey">REASSURING</div><b id="goodN">0</b><span>Within printed range</span></div><div class="sum"><div class="ey">NEEDS ATTENTION</div><b id="attnN">0</b><span>Outside printed range</span></div><div class="sum"><div class="ey">UNKNOWN</div><b id="unkN">0</b><span>Kept open rather than guessed</span></div></div><section class="section"><div class="ey">REPORTS</div><h2>Optimistic, factual reading</h2><p class="lead" id="summaryText"></p><div class="cards" id="results"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">PHARMACY = ILMB</div><h2>Same required body result, different route</h2><div class="medicine-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Medicine</th><th>Desired output</th><th>Pharmacy mechanism</th><th>Collateral branch</th><th>ILMB route</th><th>Equivalence status</th><th>Proof</th></tr></thead><tbody id="meds"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">FULL CAUSAL FLOW</div><h2>What part is affected, what its job is, and how every route converges</h2><p class="lead">pH is never treated as “body pH.” It is allowed only when the compartment, measurement and causal connection to the required output are defined.</p><div class="deep-grid" id="deep"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">ACTUAL ILMB PATH</div><h2>Action → duration → measurement → decision</h2><div class="path-grid" id="paths"></div><div class="loop" id="loop"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">SOURCE DOCUMENTS</div><h2>What has been received</h2><div class="docs" id="docs"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">IDENTITY + EVIDENCE LAYER</div><h2>LOINC · ChEBI · Reactome · pH</h2><div class="identity" id="identity"></div><div class="boundary" id="boundary"></div></section></div></main><script>
const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
async function load(){try{const r=await fetch('hospital-review-api.php');const j=await r.json();if(!r.ok||!j.ok)throw Error(j.error||'Could not build the review.');loading.hidden=true;content.hidden=false;goodN.textContent=j.summary.reassuring;attnN.textContent=j.summary.attention;unkN.textContent=j.summary.unknown;summaryText.textContent=j.summary.message;results.innerHTML=j.results.length?j.results.map(x=>`<article class="result"><span class="pill">${esc(x.status.toUpperCase())}</span><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><b>${esc(x.value)} ${esc(x.unit||'')}</b><p>${esc(x.headline)}</p><p>${esc(x.meaning)}</p><small>${x.range?'Printed range: '+esc(x.range):'No machine-readable range'}${x.loinc?' · LOINC '+esc(x.loinc):''}</small></article>`).join(''):'<p>No structured test values yet.</p>';meds.innerHTML=j.medicines.length?j.medicines.map(m=>`<tr><td>${esc(m.reported_name)}<br><small>${esc(m.strength_text||'')}</small></td><td>${esc(m.effect)}</td><td>${esc(m.mechanism)}</td><td>${esc(m.collateral)}</td><td>${esc(m.route)}</td><td>${esc(m.equivalence)}</td><td>${esc(m.measure)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7">No active medicines recorded.</td></tr>';deep.innerHTML=j.medicines.length?j.medicines.map(m=>`<article class="deep-card"><div class="deep-head"><b>${esc(m.reported_name)} ${esc(m.strength_text||'')}</b><span><strong>Target:</strong> ${esc(m.target)}</span><span><strong>Location:</strong> ${esc(m.location)}</span></div><div class="causal"><div class="node"><b>Target job</b><p>${esc(m.target_job)}</p></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node"><b>Drug action</b><p>${esc(m.mechanism)}</p></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node"><b>Desired output</b><p>${esc(m.effect)}</p></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node"><b>Why it helps</b><p>${esc(m.benefit)}</p></div><div class="arrow">↘</div><div class="node"><b>Collateral job</b><p>${esc(m.secondary_job)}</p></div><div class="arrow">→</div><div class="node"><b>Collateral effect</b><p>${esc(m.collateral)}</p></div></div><div class="matrix"><div class="cell"><b>ILMB same-output route</b><p>${esc(m.route)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>ChEBI / chemistry</b><p>${esc(m.chebi)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>LOINC / measurement</b><p>${esc(m.loinc)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>Therapy convergence</b><p>${esc(m.therapies)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>pH gate</b><p>${esc(m.ph_gate)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>Equivalence</b><p>${esc(m.equivalence)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>Action now</b><p>${esc(m.action)}</p></div><div class="cell"><b>Decision</b><p>${esc(m.decision)}</p></div></div></article>`).join(''):'<p>No medicine causal flows are available yet.</p>';paths.innerHTML=j.ilmb_paths.length?j.ilmb_paths.map(p=>`<article class="path"><div class="ey">${esc(p.medicine)}</div><h3>${esc(p.goal)}</h3><dl><div><dt>Target</dt><dd>${esc(p.target)}</dd></div><div><dt>Target job</dt><dd>${esc(p.target_job)}</dd></div><div><dt>Route</dt><dd>${esc(p.route)}</dd></div><div><dt>Action now</dt><dd>${esc(p.action)}</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>${esc(p.duration)}</dd></div><div><dt>Measure</dt><dd>${esc(p.measure)}</dd></div><div><dt>Decision</dt><dd>${esc(p.decision)}</dd></div><div><dt>Equivalence</dt><dd>${esc(p.equivalence)}</dd></div></dl></article>`).join(''):'<p>No medicine-linked ILMB paths are available yet.</p>';loop.textContent=j.loop;docs.innerHTML=j.documents.length?j.documents.map(d=>`<div class="doc"><b>${esc(d.original_filename||d.document_type)}</b><small>${esc(d.document_date||'Date not supplied')} · ${esc(String(d.document_type).replaceAll('_',' '))}</small><p>${esc(d.patient_message)}</p></div>`).join(''):'<p>No documents uploaded yet.</p>';identity.innerHTML=Object.entries(j.identity_layer).map(([k,v])=>`<span><b>${esc(k.toUpperCase())}</b> · ${esc(v)}</span>`).join('');boundary.textContent=j.boundary}catch(e){loading.textContent=e.message}}load();
</script></body></html>